# --- Data backstop ---
# Real entries must never live in this repo — the actual defence is that
# saijiki's storage code only ever writes to the OS app-data directory, and
# that the seeder reads the resolved path and refuses anything that is not
# saijiki-dev. These patterns exist only to catch a mistake, not to be relied on.
kigo/
**/kigo/
saijiki.json
**/saijiki.json
**/store/*.md
index.json
saijiki/
saijiki-dev/

# Claude Code local settings
.claude/settings.local.json
